Aug 12, 2026
Name: Shubhang Krishnakant Trivedi
Changes: (src/xc/rpa.py,  tests/accuracy/RPA/sinh, tests/accuracy/RPA/algebraic, src/solver.py, pyproject.toml)
1. Added 'sinh' mapping for the omega frequency quadrature in RPA in order to optimize the calculations and included
    older mappings under the type 'algebraic'.
2. Added 4 variants of frequency grid for the 'sinh' mapping to choose from.
3. Added tests for the self-consistent(RPA-OEP) and RPA@DFT in the folder 'tests'accuracy/RPA/sinh'.

----------------
Aug 05, 2026
Name: Shubhang Krishnakant Trivedi
Changes: (src/solver.py, src/__init__.py, pyproject.toml, tests/accuracy/RPA,  tests/README.md,
          src/scf/driver.py, src/scf/eigensolver.py, src/scf/energy.py, src/scf/hamiltonian.py,
          src/xc/functional_requirements.py, src/xc/hf.py, src/xc/oep.py, src/xc/rpa.py,
          )
1. Bug Fixes:     - RPA (static chi0, Green's function, ...) previously incorrect for non-closed-shell systems
                  - Self-consistent RPA now supports pseudopotential calculations.
2. Major Changes: - Coulomb kernel in RPA (energy, potential, and energy density) through differential equation 
                  - Made "differential equation" route of forming Coulomb kernel the default one in HF/EXX/RPA.
                  - Added new XC functional: RPA@DFT to perform non-self-consistent RPA calculation (LDA/GGA orbitals for now) 
                  - Significant memory optimizations in RPA (avoid storing large matrices -- product of eigenvectors etc)
                  - Added RPA accuracy (with timing and memory) test suite (15 cases, 5
                    elements x AE/psp x self-/non-self-consistent), with reference data
                    generated on a 24-core allocation
3. Minor Changes: - Loop over L'' and omega flipped in RPA; 
                  - Dense basis order is now user-overridable (default unchanged) instead of hardcoded to 2p+1
                  - Quadrature-order floor generalized to the largest of the standard, dense, and OEP basis orders
                  - RPA correlation energy density without complex128 instances
                  - Fix: Add boundary condition at -1/R if domain size < 9 Bohr in RPA and EXX
                  - HOMO condition (zero point shift) removed in EXX.
                  - Eigensolvers changed from gv -> gvd (full solve), gvx (only first k) -- optimization
                  - Fixed pyproject.toml packaging bug.
                  
